      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_06_select_02",
      "hash64": "C29710C33ECF4AFD",
      "text": "Ohr",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_06_select_03",
      "hash64": "C2970FC33ECF494A",
      "text": "Schweif",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "A5BC9097F6D8D2BA",
      "text": "Deine Vorstellungskraft ist echt beeindruckend!\\nDamit liegst du goldrichtig, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_02",
      "hash64": "A5BC8F97F6D8D107",
      "text": "Ein dreigeteiltes Ohr...?\\c\\nHm, ginge es hier um das Pokémon Chaneira,\\ndann wäre diese Antwort eventuell richtig...\\c\\nAber dem ist leider nicht so.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_03",
      "hash64": "A5BC8E97F6D8CF54",
      "text": "Ein dreigeteilter Schweif...?\\c\\nHm, ginge es hier um das Pokémon Tauros,\\ndann wäre diese Antwort eventuell richtig...\\c\\nAber dem ist leider nicht so.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "F723C35829571EA8",
      "text": "Denn auf dem Montanata gibt es tatsächlich\\neinen dreigeteilten Steilhang namens\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Hand des Montanata[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "F723C658295723C1",
      "text": "Wobei die Form viel zu gedrungen ist, um an eine\\nMenschenhand zu erinnern.\\c\\nDer Name spielt sicher auf die Hand irgendeines\\nPokémon an.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "F723C5582957220E",
      "text": "Auch der Blick von den Bergen in der Östlichen\\nZone 3 aufs nächtliche Fermanca City lohnt sich![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_18",
      "hash64": "F723C0582957198F",
      "text": "Die Aussicht, die sich einem von dort bietet,\\nträgt den Namen [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Fermanca-Lichtermeer[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_19",
      "hash64": "F723BF58295717DC",
      "text": "Dieser Ort soll bei frischverliebten Pärchen als\\nromantischer Treffpunkt hoch im Kurs stehen.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_20",
      "hash64": "F7193658294DDA8C",
      "text": "Oder um es in den Worten von euch jungen\\nLeuten zu sagen: Der Ort ist als Dating Spot\\r\\ntotal „in“ und eignet sich megagut für Selfies.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_21",
      "hash64": "F7193758294DDC3F",
      "text": "Andererseits gibt es natürlich auch viele Plätze,\\ndie zwar als Touristenattraktion angepriesen\\r\\nwerden, sich in Wirklichkeit aber als ziemliche\\r\\nEnttäuschung entpuppen.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 172,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_22",
      "hash64": "F7193858294DDDF2",
      "text": "Versteht mich nicht falsch. Ich möchte euch nicht\\nvon einem Besuch dieser Orte abraten.\\c\\nAber schraubt eure Erwartungen nicht allzu hoch![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
